# Always enumerate intended targets explicitly and verify each (preference)

Standing user preference: Always enumerate intended targets explicitly and verify each one was actually processed — a zero exit code is not sufficient proof of complete coverage.

## Conventions
- Always enumerate intended targets explicitly and verify each one was actually processed — a zero exit code is not sufficient proof of complete coverage.

